/* Privacy. */
"只在你的设备上处理" = "Only on your device";
"屏幕内容" = "Screen content";
"捕捉过程中，系统会持续显示捕捉提示。长截图处理屏幕画面以拼接长图，不录制或保存音频，也不保存完整视频文件。切换到的应用和弹出的通知可能进入画面，请在开始前确认。" = "The system capture indicator remains visible throughout capture. Longlet processes screen frames into a long screenshot. It does not record or save audio or store a full video file. Apps you switch to and incoming notifications may appear in the capture. Check before you start.";
"捕捉过程中，系统会持续显示捕捉提示。续页处理屏幕画面以拼接长图，不录制或保存音频，也不保存完整视频文件。切换到的应用和弹出的通知可能进入画面，请在开始前确认。" = "The system capture indicator remains visible throughout capture. Longlet processes screen frames into a long screenshot. It does not record or save audio or store a full video file. Apps you switch to and incoming notifications may appear in the capture. Check before you start.";
"本机保存" = "Local storage";
"截图和可恢复草稿保存在本机，不上传至我们的服务器，也不用于广告。捕捉文件不参与应用数据备份；卸载应用会移除应用内保存的内容。你主动保存到照片或分享到其他应用后，对应服务可能自行同步。" = "Screenshots and recoverable drafts stay on your device. They are not uploaded to our servers or used for advertising. Capture files are excluded from app data backups. Deleting the app removes content stored inside it. Copies you save to Photos or share to other apps may be synced by those services.";
"编辑与删除" = "Editing and deletion";
"隐私遮挡会以不透明色块写入导出的图片。为了能重新编辑，应用内仍保留原始画面；如需移除原始内容，请在导出后删除对应截图。删除应用内截图不会删除你已经导出的副本。" = "Redactions are applied as opaque blocks in exported images. Original frames stay in the app so you can edit again. To remove them, delete the capture after exporting. Deleting a capture in Longlet does not delete copies you have already exported.";
"照片权限" = "Photo permission";
"只有主动保存时，才请求向照片图库添加图片的权限。无需读取你的照片图库，也无需提供麦克风权限。" = "Permission to add images to Photos is requested only when you choose to save. Longlet does not need to read your photo library or access your microphone.";
"购买" = "Purchases";
"购买与恢复购买由 Apple 处理。长截图只验证购买状态，不收集付款资料。每周导出计数保存在本机。" = "Apple handles purchases and restores. Longlet verifies purchase status without collecting payment details. Weekly export counts are stored on your device.";
"购买与恢复购买由 Apple 处理。续页只验证购买状态，不收集付款资料。每周导出计数保存在本机。" = "Apple handles purchases and restores. Longlet verifies purchase status without collecting payment details. Weekly export counts are stored on your device.";

